# drift-storage

Storage accounting for drift-storage: how much each account uses and which shard a file lives on.

## Plans

| Plan | Quota |
|---|---|
| free | 512 MiB |
| team | 200 GiB |
| archive | 2 TiB |

Quotas are kept in KiB in src/plans.js.

## Quotas

An upload is refused when it would take the account past its plan's quota. An upload that brings usage exactly to the quota is accepted.

Usage counts whole 4 KiB blocks, because that is what the storage backend allocates: a 1-byte file uses 4 KiB.

